# The kinds the app must clean up (garbage-walk.py --gone-file), from the nightly-74 discovery walk.
# Claude Code's scratch for the app's sessions
^/private/tmp/claude-[0-9]+/[^/]+-coordination/[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$
# a lease's engine profile and its -standing copy
/com\.richos\.app/engine-profiles/[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}(-standing)?$
# Claude Code's MCP logs for the app's coordination folder
/Library/Caches/claude-cli-nodejs/[^/]+-coordination/mcp-logs-[^/]+/[^/]+$
# the voice speed measurement's probe utterance
/richos-voice-calibration/probe\.wav$
